File: [contracts/token_sales/HarTokenSale.sol#L186-L195](https://github.com/harmonixfi/core-contracts/blob/979b550c812157b8831d5d9b19f68df9a2892a41/contracts/token_sales/HarTokenSale.sol#L186-L195)

