_No response_

### External pre-conditions

_No response_

### Attack Path

_No response_

### Impact

Errors in global accounting data can lead to incorrect calculations in critical system processes.


### PoC

_No response_

### Mitigation

Modify and improve the relevant data synchronization mechanism.

