> 
> https://github.com/othernet-global/salty-io/commit/5766592880737a5e682bb694a3a79e12926d48a5

**[Picodes (Judge) commented](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-01-salty-findings/issues/712#issuecomment-1967449721):**
