[CidNFT.sol#L147](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-01-canto-identity/blob/main/src/CidNFT.sol#L147)<br>
[CidNFT.sol#L165](https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-01-canto-identity/blob/main/src/CidNFT.sol#L165)<br>
